<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our Lord has been anointed for</l><l>Announcing good news to the poor,</l><l>Release to captives—ye much more—</l><l>The blind, their sight He has restored.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>You, Lord, have sent away, released,</l><l>Those once oppressed, whose bondage ceased.</l><l>You have proclaimed today to be</l><l>God’s promised year of Jubilee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, You have now fulfilled God’s Word;</l><l>Your proclamation we have heard.</l><l>We join with You, our hearts You’ve stirred;</l><l>God’s kingdom’s here, the age has turned.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
